        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Stellar Witch and engage in magical battles across the cosmos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of constellations and grow into a powerful grand sorceress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of powerful enemies, collect gold, and acquire even stronger constellation tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive against increasingly stronger foes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Witch</i> is a unique inventory-management + dodge-action roguelike game where you become a witch mastering the power of constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features strategic constellation placement and fast reflex gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Inventory Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect constellation tiles in five tiers: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each constellation has a unique size, shape, ability, and adjacency effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing constellations next to each other can trigger special synergy effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the optimal layout within limited space!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/c49b171a4061b5e9080e8a3f4509a1bf.poster.avif?t=1769133453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/c49b171a4061b5e9080e8a3f4509a1bf.webm?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/c49b171a4061b5e9080e8a3f4509a1bf.mp4?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-based Real-Time Dodge Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense 1:1 battles against monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on constellation tiles to instantly activate their powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine attack, defense, and debuff abilities to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read enemy patterns and move quickly to survive!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try new constellation setups each time and see how long you can survive against ever-stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/1363643cbc4094a56d24cd5890da3f08.poster.avif?t=1769133453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/1363643cbc4094a56d24cd5890da3f08.webm?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/1363643cbc4094a56d24cd5890da3f08.mp4?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Stellar Witch and engage in magical battles across the cosmos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of constellations and grow into a powerful grand sorceress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of powerful enemies, collect gold, and acquire even stronger constellation tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive against increasingly stronger foes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Witch</i> is a unique inventory-management + dodge-action roguelike game where you become a witch mastering the power of constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features strategic constellation placement and fast reflex gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Inventory Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect constellation tiles in five tiers: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each constellation has a unique size, shape, ability, and adjacency effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing constellations next to each other can trigger special synergy effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the optimal layout within limited space!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/c49b171a4061b5e9080e8a3f4509a1bf.poster.avif?t=1769133453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/c49b171a4061b5e9080e8a3f4509a1bf.webm?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/c49b171a4061b5e9080e8a3f4509a1bf.mp4?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-based Real-Time Dodge Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense 1:1 battles against monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on constellation tiles to instantly activate their powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine attack, defense, and debuff abilities to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read enemy patterns and move quickly to survive!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try new constellation setups each time and see how long you can survive against ever-stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/1363643cbc4094a56d24cd5890da3f08.poster.avif?t=1769133453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/1363643cbc4094a56d24cd5890da3f08.webm?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/1363643cbc4094a56d24cd5890da3f08.mp4?t=1769133453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "&quot;Stellar Witch&quot; is a grid-dodge action game with inventory management. Become a star-powered witch on a journey to become the Grand Mage. Collect gold in battle, buy and place constellations, and use their powers and synergies to fight ever-stronger enemies.",
